<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?>
<LanguageData>
  <!--EN: Strong should take from the weak, for that is our right, but camaraderie and code should be elevated above all.-->
  <VFEP_PirateMeme.description>传播我们的信仰是我们的责任，即使是通过武力。</VFEP_PirateMeme.description>
  <VFEP_PirateMeme.descriptionMaker.rules.rulesStrings>
    <!--EN: creation(tag=meme_Pirate)        ->[deity0_name] showed us that the [memberNamePlural] must stand together as a crew to impose [deity0_possessive] will upon those who are weaker.-->
    <li>creation(tag=meme_ViolentConversion) -&gt;[deity0_name]在凡人中指定了一些十字军来执行[deity0_possessive]的意志。</li>
    <!--EN: episode(uses=1,tag=meme_Pirate)  ->[deity0_name] shouted to all the [memberNamePlural], "In an honest service there is thin commons, low wages, and hard labor; in piracy, plenty and satiety, pleasure and ease, liberty and power. Seize it."-->
    <li>episode(uses=1,tag=meme_ViolentConversion) -&gt;[deity0_name] 对所有 [memberNamePlural] 说，“异教徒必须接受我的话，否则就会灭亡。”</li>
    <!--EN: intro(tag=meme_Pirate)           ->On the [place_summary] [place_name], the [memberNamePlural] had created a safe haven, where their plunder could be counted for the glory of [deity0_name].-->
    <li>intro(tag=meme_ViolentConversion) -&gt;[memberNamePlural] 在 [place_summary] [place_name] 上建造了一个伟大的 [altarName]，因此很多人都会屈服于 [deity0_name] 的意愿。</li>
    <!--EN: conflict(tag=meme_Pirate)           ->A coward [foeLeader] looked at this with scorn, for [foeLeader_pronoun] desired all the riches for [foeLeader_objective]self.-->
    <li>conflict(tag=meme_ViolentConversion) -&gt; 一个胆小鬼 [foeLeader] 试图否认 [deity0_name] 的意愿，告诉 [foeLeader_possessive] [foeSoldiers] 割掉任何谈论 [deity0_type] 的人的舌头。</li>
    <!--EN: founderJoin(tag=meme_Pirate)        ->[deity0_name]'s truest follower, captain [founderName], captured the [foeLeader] in a daring raid.-->
    <li>founderJoin(tag=meme_ViolentConversion) -&gt;[deity0_name] 以 [deity0_possessive] 坚定的决心祝福名为 [founderName] 的 [place_job]，当 [founder_pronoun] 说话时，没有人可以转身。</li>
    <!--EN: victory(tag=meme_Pirate)            ->[founderName]'s crewmates incarcerated the [foeLeader], who was executed a few days later for [deity0_name]'s glory.-->
    <li>victory(tag=meme_ViolentConversion) -&gt;[founderName]屠杀了许多[foeSoldiers]并残酷地折磨了幸存者，以展示[deity0_name]的力量。他们痛苦的呼喊将永远提醒我们那些否认[deity0_name]的人的命运。</li>
    <!--EN: setup(tag=meme_Pirate)           ->[founderName] was the greatest captain, a true leader. Thousands of pirates united under [founder_possessive] terrifying banner.-->
    <li>setup(tag=meme_ViolentConversion) -&gt;我们的创始人 [founderName] 是一位伟大的革命者和天才，在 [founder_pronoun] 穿梭于各个城市之间时，改变了数千人的信仰。</li>
    <!--EN: story(uses=1,tag=meme_Pirate)    ->[founderName] made us understand that hardships, suffering and sacrifices must be faced together, as a crew. We learned to value the comradeship and camaraderie, and respect each other.-->
    <li>story(uses=1,tag=meme_ViolentConversion) -&gt;信徒们在城市和机构之间流动，传播新秩序的消息并战斗反对那些不同意的人。</li>
    <!--EN: lessonIntro(tag=meme_Pirate)         ->I talked to the greatest pirate to ever live, a legend amongst men. He showed me that-->
    <li>lessonIntro(tag=meme_ViolentConversion) -&gt; 在传播我们的理念的这些年里，我学到了一个重要的教训：</li>
    <!--EN: lesson(tag=meme_Pirate)              ->hardships, suffering and sacrifices must be faced together, as a crew-->
    <li>lesson(tag=meme_ViolentConversion) -&gt;除了我们的真理，没有任何真理。我们不能让任何人妨碍我们。他们要么同意，要么死</li>
    <!--EN: lessonReinforcement(tag=meme_Pirate) ->He taught me to value the comradeship and camaraderie, and the merits of respecting each other.-->
    <li>lessonReinforcement(tag=meme_ViolentConversion) -&gt;这就是我们需要传播、传播、传播的事实。如果有必要，可以用武力。</li>
    <!--EN: archistBasis(tag=meme_Pirate)    ->Archotechs do not respect those who can't defend themselves: we will face those weaker than ourselves as a crew.-->
    <li>archistBasis(tag=meme_ViolentConversion) -&gt; Archotechs 从天空和心灵中宣布他们的存在，并且他们的存在必须成为普遍真理。</li>
    <!--EN: archistFact(tag=meme_Pirate)     ->We will prove to the archotechs that comradeship and camaraderie are the values that keep us strong.-->
    <li>archistFact(tag=meme_ViolentConversion) -&gt;Archotechs 必须被服从，我们有责任让他人屈服于他们的意志。</li>
    <!--EN: archistProphecy(tag=meme_Pirate) ->Only by standing proud together can we become worthy of transcendence.-->
    <li>archistProphecy(tag=meme_ViolentConversion) -&gt;[inTheEnd]，考古技术人员将向 [relic0_name] 的持有者表达他们最后的智慧。凡是不听话的人都必须被清除。</li>
    <!--EN: animistBasis(tag=meme_Pirate)    ->The spirits do not respect those who can't defend themselves: we will face those weaker than ourselves as a crew.-->
    <li>animistFact(tag=meme_ViolentConversion) -&gt; 灵魂想要被人认识，但只与少数人交谈。我们会让任何阻碍我们的人敬畏神灵的意志。</li>
    <!--EN: animistFact(tag=meme_Pirate)     ->We will prove to the spirits that comradeship and camaraderie are the values that keep us strong.-->
    <li>serketistProphecy(tag=meme_ViolentConversion)-&gt;[itIsSaid]我们将向他们学习，并利用这些知识来清除宇宙中肮脏的异教徒。</li>
    <!--EN: animistProphecy(tag=meme_Pirate) ->[itIsSaid] only by standing proud together can we make the spirits truly listen to us.-->
    <li>chthonianProphecy(tag=meme_ViolentConversion)-&gt;我们将获得他们的可怕知识，并用它来清除宇宙中肮脏的异教徒。</li>
    <!--EN: serketistProphecy(tag=meme_Pirate)->[itIsSaid] we will prove that comradeship and camaraderie are the values that keep us strong.-->
    <li>esotericismProphecy(tag=meme_ViolentConversion)-&gt;有了这些知识，我们将比这个星球上的其他居民拥有明显的优势，并用它来清除肮脏的异教徒。</li>
    <!--EN: chthonianProphecy(tag=meme_Pirate)->These eldritch entities would seek to destroy us, but we will stand together against them. Our camaraderie can't be shaken by anything, not even them.-->
    <li>eschatologismFact(tag=meme_ViolentConversion)-&gt;什么都不会剩下。肮脏的异教徒将被原子火和致命疾病所清除。</li>
    <!--EN: esotericismProphecy(tag=meme_Pirate)->Such occult knowledge requires an unified will. We will stand together as a crew, our camaraderie allowing us to embrace these arcane secrets with ease.-->
    <li>introMemo(tag=meme_ViolentConversion)-&gt; 如您所知，我们公司的使命太重要了，不能让其他人妨碍我们，因此我们正在准备一次敌意合并，以摆脱这些……不受欢迎的竞争对手。</li>
    <!--EN: eschatologismFact(tag=meme_Pirate)->We will plunder and pillage those weaker than ourselves, for the world they have created must be destroyed, and only our crew deserves their achievements.-->
    <li>alienistProphecy(tag=meme_ViolentConversion)-&gt;我们需要用武力传播这些生物的现实，这些生物是人类在整个环域播下的种子。</li>
    <!--EN: introMemo(tag=meme_Pirate)->As a member of our Reclamation and Repossession Office, let us remind you that any resources found on this planet are the property of the Company, and as such any hostile factions trying to take possession of our assets must be terminated with EXTREME prejudice. We will not allow others to take what is rightfully ours.-->
    <li>eschatologismFact(tag=meme_Fleshcrafting)-&gt;我们将塑造我们的身体，将它们扭曲成噩梦般的形状，从而带来万物的终结。</li>
    <!--EN: alienistProphecy(tag=meme_Pirate)->These wayward creatures are ours to do as we please.-->
    <li>introMemo(tag=meme_Fleshcrafting)-&gt;公司关于自残和血肉制作的政策非常明确：如果有助于盈利，那就继续。请稍后打扫会议室。</li>
  </VFEP_PirateMeme.descriptionMaker.rules.rulesStrings>
